	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Please excuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"After driving away the suspicious warrior in the Imperial Palace dungeon─",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"I come to check Empress Hisui's room, just in case.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Whatever brings you here at this hour?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We recently encountered intruders in the Imperial Palace, so I've come to ensure your safety.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Empress Hisui turns around from her desk to stare at me in puzzlement.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I appreciate the concern, but I am perfectly fine. Indeed, I was not even aware there was such a disturbance.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm relieved to hear that.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Incidentally, by 'intruders,' do you mean to say...”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Warriors, yes.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Empress Hisui's expression darkens.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Might you know their names?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, I do not.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“However, I can confirm that a warrior named Maki Kazuma was in league with the intruders.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Maki...”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do you know of him?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Only as much as any other Imperial does.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Did you manage to apprehend him?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm afraid that he was able to evade us.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even after being severely wounded, he displayed a most fearful tenacity.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That puts me ill at ease.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We are sparing no effort in pursuing him, even as we speak.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I must return to take charge of the investigation, so if you would please excuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"I turn on my heel after bowing to Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, those injuries!”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"I'd taken a military-issue painkiller, so I'd completely forgotten.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"I received this wound when I engaged Maki in the underground passage.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've taken a painkiller, so this is but a...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please take a seat right here.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Empress Hisui drags me by the hand, sitting me on her own bed.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"My blood immediately seeps into her expensive bedding, but she pays it absolutely no mind.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"She kneels before me and busies herself with unpacking a first aid kit.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I'm applying disinfectant. This may sting slightly.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"She begins treating me with surgical movements even before the words have left her mouth.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You have yourself a first aid kit? How unexpected.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“In this day and age, one ought be prepared for anything.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It has proven most handy now, has it not?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please bear with it just a little longer.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I-I understand.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“This may sting somewhat.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ahh...!”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please hold still!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It is imperative to treat a wound immediately to prevent scarring.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Y-Yes...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I was right to think after the bombing that she's well accustomed to this.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"She definitely has experience treating wounds from somewhere.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Might your comrades be injured, as well?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I lost most of my subordinates.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"It wouldn't be wrong to describe warriors as demons of the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"They don't flinch no matter how many bullets you pump into them, and a single swing of their blades is enough to claim multiple lives.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Several of those killed in action today were veterans\nthat've fought by my side since before I even earned my commission.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"They were all brave soldiers, yet they were cut down as easily as paper.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We suffered terrible losses from just a single warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You have my condolences.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Would that the world could be free from such needless conflict.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I, too, pray for lasting peace in the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But so long as the current regime remains in place, peace will remain far away indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Whatever might you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That man thinks of nothing but lining his own pockets.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty is surely not ignorant of how much the people are suffering under his tyranny?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Empress Hisui silently lowers her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"It is as clear an affirmation as any.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even if the warriors were to lay down their arms, the common people would surely be the next to rise up.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The only way to achieve a peaceful future is to take care of the root of the problem.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, you mustn't say such things out loud!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Sensing the meaning behind my declaration, Empress Hisui hastily admonishes me.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"But I can't afford to stop now.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"I came here today to secure her cooperation with my plan.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"I know all about the bugs Okonogi has placed in this room, and I'm feeding them dummy data as we speak.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I insist.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“For the future of the Empire, I beseech Your Majesty's ear.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"I half-drag Empress Hisui onto her bed and sit down right next to her.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“U-Um, I'm still busy treating...”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I insist.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I hold Empress Hisui's wandering hands firmly down to her lap.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon for my frankness, but do you intend to live forever as Okonogi's puppet, Your Majesty?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It is unfortunate, but I have no choice.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am powerless to change my situation.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, I believe you are gravely mistaken about the power you hold.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"I clasp her hands with even greater strength.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, you alone are capable of casting Okonogi down and bringing about peace to the Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What terrifying words!”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Empress Hisui recoils, clasping her hands to her chest.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“In the first place, one such as yourself should have no need of my cooperation─you ought to be capable of deciding the Empire's future on a whim.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, that isn't the case.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Okonogi is paying the governor-general an enormous bribe. And of course, all of it is taken from the hands of the Imperial people.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As a result, the governor-general refuses to lift even a finger to check against Okonogi's tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Republic isn't about to kill its golden goose, no matter how long we wait.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If anyone is to take down Okonogi, it will have to be someone from within the Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But is the governor-general not your own...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As much as I hate it... Yes, he is my own father.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Truthfully, my motivation does stem in part from a desire to correct the mistakes of my kin.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"I intentionally pause, allowing Empress Hisui's compassionate gaze to wash over me before continuing.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But even more importantly, any attempt at regime change will certainly fail unless it comes from within.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No amount of reforms handed down by the Republic are likely to last for long.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“People will only fight to protect that which they won through their own efforts.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty and none other is the living embodiment of the Imperial people's will. Only you are capable of casting down Okonogi and ushering in a new era!”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Empress Hisui is universally revered by the Imperial people.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"If she is the one to topple Okonogi, the people will undoubtedly lend their support to the new regime.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Conversely, they would never welcome the Republic ostensibly replacing one puppet administration with another.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"It is absolutely imperative that the Imperial people are able to win their own freedom.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Even so, however am I to defeat the chancellor?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have no military forces or subordinates who will answer to me.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That is where you are mistaken, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"I pause meaningfully and stare into her searching eyes.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, you have the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You need only to put out the call, and they will surely answer.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The warriors?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“This goes without saying, but the warriors live and die by their fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“They will surely rise up at a call to arms from the Empress herself.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, you alone are capable of wielding the warriors and reshaping this Empire to your will.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Empress Hisui clenches her fists tightly in front of her chest.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"But despite this subdued reaction, the excitement raging in her heart is as clear as day.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"After a few seconds' hesitation, Empress Hisui fixes me with her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"The resolute eyes that stare into mine bear no resemblance to those of a caged bird.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Might you discuss your plan with me in greater detail?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I take the time to explain my plan.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"First, Empress Hisui must call on the warriors' commander-in-chief, Inou Hotori, to overthrow Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"She is to arrange for Inou Hotori to rally the warriors and stage an armed uprising when the time is right.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Once Okonogi is vanquished, Empress Hisui can proclaim herself the legitimate sovereign of the Empire, whereupon the Republic would proceed to acknowledge her claim.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"She would then rule the Empire in both name and fact, and the warriors would be pardoned for their crimes and provided suitable positions within the new regime.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Then, once the dust has settled, Empress Hisui would be able to issue an Imperial decree to transition the government into a parliamentary democracy.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Of course, the status of the Emperor would still be preserved as a figurehead under the new constitution.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"Meanwhile, I'll be playing my part by making arrangements within the Republican Army, sabotaging the Imperial Palace's security, and supplying the warriors with weapons.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You are saying that the Empire will remain a vassal state of the Republic to the very end?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That will not change.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But if Okonogi's oppression can be brought to an end, the people of the Empire will be much more prosperous than they are now.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I trust Your Majesty to decide what is truly more important.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Empress Hisui is clearly on board with my plan.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"However meek this girl might be, there's no way that she\nwouldn't yearn to finally spread her wings after three long years of captivity.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"It's all too easy to hook her in with a noble-sounding cause.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yours sounds like a wonderfully-laid plan, but why have you decided only now to propose it?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've been fighting the warriors for over three years now, ever since the end of the war.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yet the results of all my efforts are self-evident. I have failed in all my attempts to wipe them out.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't want any more of my men's blood on my hands, so I believe it's high time to come to a mutual agreement.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“After all, my ultimate goal has always been to restore order to the Empire and set it down the road to democracy.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Of course, I have to admit that there is still a part of me that hates to forgive the warriors so easily...”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"...And that's why I told her a major lie.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"In the plan I outlined to Empress Hisui, the warriors will be pardoned in the end.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"But I have absolutely no intention of letting them off the hook.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"The ultimate goal of this plan is to wipe out every last one of them.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Unless they are dealt with for good, we'll never be able to exert our hegemony over the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades have retreated underground and become increasingly hard to track ever since the arrests we made on August 8th.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"And the best way to get them to stick their heads up all at once is to enlist the Empress's help.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"As soon as she commands their ringleader, Inou Hotori, to overthrow Okonogi, this information will be promulgated all throughout their underground network.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"That fealty of theirs will surely compel them to triumphantly rise up in answer to the Empress's call to arms.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"All I need to do is round them all up in the Imperial Palace once they've eliminated Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"If all goes according to plan, both those meddlesome terrorists and the tyrant standing in the way of democratization will be taken care of in one fell swoop.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Empress Hisui will surely resent me for it, but that hardly matters to me.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"If she refuses to cooperate, it'd be a simple matter to replace her current gilded cage with one of Republican steel. ",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, will you make a stand with me?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"I reach out to clasp her hands in mine once again.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I would ask one condition in exchange for my cooperation.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Anything.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Once we have overthrown the chancellor, I ask that you put an end to the institution of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Abolish... the Imperial government?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"I never could've imagined this would be her condition.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"If anything, I expected her to try to save her own skin.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Y-You would abdicate your own position?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Well, I've never thought of such a station as anything to be thankful for.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...What do you intend for yourself afterwards, Your Majesty?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Pathetically, I can't stop myself from stammering out one question after another.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I wonder that myself.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I suppose you may do with me as you see fit.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Of course, I have no intentions of quietly returning to my gilded cage, however.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"For just a brief moment, the force of will radiating from her searching eyes wholly renders me their captive.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Up until now, I'd thought her an easily manipulable girl, but it seems that her true heart of hearts contains depths\nI've yet to fathom.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Do you find these terms acceptable?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Of course, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Then you have my cooperation.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"This time, I find my hands wrapped up in her grip.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I shall not rest until the Empire's crown belongs to Your Majesty in both name and fact.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If there is anything at all that troubles you, please confide in me.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You have my full confidence, Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"After discussing some more of the finer details with Empress Hisui, I withdraw from her room.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Once I've made it a short distance away, Okonogi approaches me from the other side of the corridor.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, you have my sincerest gratitude for repelling the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Never did I expect that Maki Kazuma would invite his allies into the Imperial Palace...”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You couldn't see that coming?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wouldn't you normally be suspicious the moment a warrior defects to enlist in the Forbidden Guard?”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But not only did you hire him without asking any questions, you left him to handle security all on his own.\nWhat's wrong with you?”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“That man swore on the name of House Maki that he would not betray me.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“As a fellow Imperial, I must confess that his vow moved me deeply.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“My oh my. When you get to be my age, it's only natural to be weak to such sentimentalism.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“From my point of view, it just looks like you wanted the warriors to get away this whole time.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Perish the thought.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It was merely a brief lapse of sound judgment.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Merely? Your lack of sound judgment damn near got me killed!”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“My humblest apologies. I beg your forgiveness.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Okonogi lightly inclines his head in a shallow bow.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"It's a gesture that betrays not one shred of contrition.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, what's done is done.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But this incident has made it clear that the Forbidden Guard has no business in protecting the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Republican Army will be taking over all security duties from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Why, perish the thought! I can see to my own pro─”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That would certainly have been more convenient for us, too.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But because that doesn't seem entirely possible, we'll step in to oversee your protection.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“After all, you wouldn't want the warriors to kill you in your sleep, would you?”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"I can't afford to back down here.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Having to guard the Imperial Palace alongside the Forbidden Guard would greatly hinder my plans.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"By hook or by crook, I need to secure free rein over security in the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, I know. What do you say to putting the Forbidden Guard through some additional training?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll make arrangements with an elite Republican Army training ground. I'll see to it that your men will have carte blanche access to all the facilities.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In two, three months' time, you'll hardly recognize them as a fighting force.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Why, I could not possibly ask so much of you...”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll spare no expense for the protection of the Imperial Palace, not to mention your own person. Do I make myself clear?”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“...You have my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Glad you could understand.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well then, I'll go ahead and make arrangements with that training ground right away.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"I'll have the Forbidden Guard shipped off to some remote island.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Without them around, the Imperial Palace will be all mine.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Effective tomorrow, the Republican Army will assume all responsibilities for the Imperial Palace's security.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The plan to use Kokuan as bait might have failed, but I'll be sure to put an end to the warriors this next time.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Your confidence is most encouraging.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“But might I inquire what sort of plan, exactly, you have in mind?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll keep my cards close to my chest for now. It's more interesting that way, wouldn't you say?”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Hahaha, it is truly as you say. I can feel my blood growing restless already.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Can I trust you to arrange a command post and lodging for my men?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Consider it done.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Then I'll be taking my leave.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"I sidestep around Okonogi as he offers me a bow.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"That's one step forward.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Ah, it nearly slipped my mind, Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"He calls out to me from behind.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It seems you have been conferring Her Majesty with all manner of new ideas as of late. For that, you have my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Her Majesty certainly has a most curious mind.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't you think she'll make for a splendid Empress someday?”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“That would certainly take a considerable weight off my shoulders!”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, until next time.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"I turn on my heel and leave Okonogi behind me.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"As usual, I have no idea what that man is thinking.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"I can't even tell if he seriously wants to crush the warriors or not, but whatever.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"I had to leave the Kokuan matter entirely in his hands, but now, I can get back to my original task of dealing with the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"This time, for sure, I'll wipe them all out.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Only then will the winds of democracy finally be able to blow through the Empire.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
